{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>What shall we eat in the seventh year.</b> Now they could have eaten from the produce of the sixth year; but in the seventh year what cleaves to them is 'we shall not sow and we shall not harvest,' so that it is as if he said: What shall we eat in the eighth year, since in the seventh we did not sow?"], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:28:19.605009360Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}